icing of 96 percent leave little doubt about the outcome.", "watch": "A late scandal involving Healey or an unexpected anti-incumbent turnout wave could narrow the margin, though the expected result would be very unlikely to change.", "confidence": "high", "notes": ["Incumbent Maura Healey (D) is running."]}, "overview": "Governor Maura Healey enters the final weeks of her reelection bid with a commanding position in deep-blue Massachusetts. Every independent poll this fall has shown her leading Republican Mike Minogue by double digits, including a mid-October Suffolk University survey putting the margin at 23 points. All eight national and nonpartisan raters classify the race as Solid or Safe Democratic, and prediction markets give Healey roughly a 96 percent chance of winning.\n\nMinogue has campaigned on affordability and worked to introduce himself to voters, but his ticket has been rocked by the arrest and campaign suspension of his running mate, prompting him to say he would govern without a lieutenant governor. President Trump's standing in Massachusetts adds a further headwind for Republicans. Independent Andrea James is on the ballot but has not registered as a significant factor in polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9961, "margin": 18.83}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9968, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9983, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9947, "margin": 17.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9929, "margin": 17.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9875, "margin": 17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9913, "margin": 17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9921, "margin": 17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9908, "margin": 17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.996, "margin": 18.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9953, "margin": 18.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9946, "margin": 18.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.996, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_